SUMMARY:Free Fishing Derby Day
DESCRIPTION:Montclair Police is inviting youths age 5-17 to participate in the Free Fishing Derby at Edgemont Park on June 27. Bait will be provided. Bring your fishing pole as there are a limited number of loaner poles. Snacks will be provided. \nRegister here: https://club.spond.com/landing/signup/montclairpal/form/92DCCE48C1AD439D8FE37A714B759D0A \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
