SUMMARY:Nature Explorers: June
DESCRIPTION:Nature Explorers – June\nJune 27 @ 10:30 am – 12:30 pm\nIntroducing our new FREE family program\, Nature Explorers. This is a free program offered on select Saturdays. Each session will be host to a different garden or nature inspired activity such as\, planting in our Kitchen Garden\, creating and adding to a community art project\, seasonal scavenger hunts\, bird watching\, and much more! Summer sessions are weather permitting as activities will be held fully outdoors.\nFree\, pre-registration is encouraged. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
