UID:10140408-1782662400-1782669600@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:Art Closing: Lovlee Tang at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Come out for one final look at the works of our artist-in-residence: Lovlee Tang!\nLovlee Tang is a mixed-media artist\, creative entrepreneur\, and mother of four based in Bloomfield\, New Jersey. Drawing inspiration from family history\, memory\, and the strength of women across generations\, her work explores themes of connection\, identity\, resilience\, and legacy. A recurring motif in her art is the presence of four women-symbolizing family\, sisterhood\, motherhood\, and the enduring bonds between generations. \nUsing recycled papers\, vintage imagery\, paint\, handwritten words\, and found materials\, Lovlee creates layered collages\, and abstract works that honor the stories of the women who came before her. \nIn addition to her studio practice\, Lovlee is the founder of Lovlee Art Studios\, where she uses art as a vehicle for building creativity\, confidence\, and community among children and adults alike. Her work reflects her belief that art has the power to heal\, inspire\, and preserve the stories that matter most. \n“Every piece I create is an invitation to remember\, honor\, and celebrate the women whose love and strength live on through us.” – Lovlee Tang \nLovlee will be on-site from 4-6pm to discuss her art\, process\, and influences. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/art-closing-lovlee-tang-at-montclair-brewery/
